{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:647","content":{"id":647,"title":"SVG 介绍","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"概念"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 全称为 Scalable Vector Graphics（可缩放矢量图），它是一种图像格式，使用形状、路径等来组成图像内容，与一般由像素描述的图像不同，SVG 可以做到与分辨率无关的清晰度，无论放大多少倍，图像还是一样的清晰。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 SVG 与分辨率无关，所以我们经常使用 SVG 制作 icon，可以在各个平台进行使用，不用准备 2x，3x 不同尺寸的图。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此之外，SVG 还有很多优点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 是文本文件，可以直接打开使用编辑器进行修改"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比于 PNG、JPEG、GIF，具有更小的尺寸"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 中的文字可以被选中"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持动画，可以通过 SMIL 或者 CSS 使得 SVG 中的元素产生动画效果"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"..."}]}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 作为一种图片，我们可以直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者在 CSS 中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"background-image","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行引用"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img src=\"xxx.svg\">","language":"html","uuid":"ecb72025-eea5-4d30-be5c-7df899bb7897","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"background-image: url(xxx.svg)","language":"css","uuid":"45efde93-f448-4b61-9d9d-fea8ba4d0749","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还可以通过"},{"type":"formatted","text":" embed object iframe","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来引用一个 SVG 图片"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<iframe src=\"xxx.svg\"></iframe>","language":"html","uuid":"b780a5e8-1bda-4b2a-b737-7cccff5caf6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以直接在网页中内联"},{"type":"formatted","text":" <svg>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签来显示一幅图像"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#dae8fc\" />\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"100\" fill=\"#d5e8d4\" />\n</svg>","language":"html","uuid":"f9b56e02-90a2-4109-bd9b-a62606263c1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<svg width=\"150\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 200\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#dae8fc\" />\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"100\" r=\"100\" fill=\"#d5e8d4\" />\n</svg>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"SVG","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本概念","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"SVG 介绍","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:647","type":"doc","id":647}}],"prevPage":{"title":"基本概念","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},"nextPage":{"title":"视口、viewBox 与 preserveAspectRatio","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:651","type":"doc","id":651}},"createTime":1703603281919,"updateTime":1743303640564,"projectId":45},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640564},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"formatVersion":1,"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.4","minAppVersion":"0.59.0","apiVersion":1,"platform":"desktop","format":"cjs","main":"main.js","editor":true,"categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"integrity":{"main.js":"eafe74429244b57e1dce6a889e1e925f0cf178f5942afe95485f081a8fa048bf","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8"},"styles":"main.css"},"entry":"../../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/main.js","styles":"../../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../../styles/55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654.css","integrity":"55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654"}]}